      "id": "isthmus_7702_authorization_invalid_nonce_ignored",
      "comment": "AUTH (addr7) has state nonce 5, but the authorization tuple claims nonce 7 (mismatch, too high). Per EIP-7702, an authorization whose nonce does not match the authority's current state nonce is silently skipped (not an error) -- the outer tx still succeeds (status=1), but AUTH's code/nonce are left completely unchanged (no delegation installed, no nonce bump). Negative-space companion to B4.",
